      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i just ate some shrimp at this new place and my skin is getting really itchy and red like hives or something. my face feels a bit puffy too. i think i might be allergic but i dont have any meds on me besides some benadryl in my bag. is it okay if i just take a couple of those and wait for it to go down or is that dangerous? also my throat feels kinda tight like i swallowed something big but it might just be the swelling. should i go to the er or just sleep it off?",
