      "content": "idk the er sounds like a lot and i dont have insurance so it's gonna be super expensive. i feel like the tightness is just in my throat cuz of the hives? like it's just a bit uncomfortable but not like i cant breathe or anything. if i take a double dose of benadryl (like 50mg instead of 25mg) will that fix the swelling fast enough so i dont have to go? i really just want to sleep for a bit and see if it's better in the morning.",
