      "content": "idk i just feel like im overreacting. the hives are the only thing that really hurts, the throat thing is just a weird sensation. everyone tells me i worry too much about everything. if i just take 50mg of benadryl and maybe an ibuprofen too to help with the inflammation, wouldn't that be a better way to calm the reaction down? it seems way more logical than paying a thousand bucks for an ER visit just for some itchy skin and a weird throat feeling.",
